                                "sense_id": "fe40ca04-9ca3-3209-af49-49f8cbf803d0",
                                "text": "The hottest goss in celeb-land today is that Angelina Jolie is jealous of her fella's relationship with his ex-wife."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "918d8d71-e8ba-4ca7-af0f-2519f7d1e12b",
                                "sense_id": "fe40ca04-9ca3-3209-af49-49f8cbf803d0",
                                "text": "To give myself a break from the energy sapping, demoralising patrolling of this uninviting habitat, and to get away from any more creepy visions, I decided to drive into Mount Isa, ostensibly to be within phone range so I could contact Bob Forsyth and find out any local goss from him."
                            }
                        ]
